        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Reguitti SDK068PV/PA Contemporary Oval Double Pocket Door Lock Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nVery contemporary oval double pocket door privacy lock set that offers high fashion and high quality function. Packaged as a complete set that includes the privacy mortise lock body, two (2) oval flush pulls for lock, two (2) oval flush pulls for non locking door, two (2) edge pulls, a strike plate and all mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in  high quality finishes for pocket doors up to  <b>2-1/4\" thick</b>.  The edge pulls are pressure mounted into the doors edge. The oval flush pulls are installed with concealed screw mounting for that clean contemporary appearance. Made in Italy by Reguitti.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via an emergency turn. A privacy lock does not offer security, it offers privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available for single pocket doors: \r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-oval-pocket-lock-privacy-reguitti-sdk068pv\"><b>Contemporary Oval Pocket Lock Privacy</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-oval-pocket-door-passage-set-reguitti-sdk068pa\"><b>Contemporary Oval Pocket Door Pull Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe privacy mortise lock is installed on one door. The strike plate is installed on the other door. When locked, the two pocket doors are tightly hook together. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the SDK068PV/PA Contemporary Oval Pocket Lock Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Body Height: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Body Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Body Depth: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Faceplate Height: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Total Height: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Total Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Total Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Door Cutout Depth:  3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Projection: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Door Cutout Height: 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Door Cutout Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/contemporary-round-fingertip-edge-pull-ahi-ep1272\">Edge Pull</a> Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDK068PV.pdf?v=1691093348\" target=\"new\"><b>SDK068PV/PA Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDK068PV-SDK096PV-template.pdf?v=1691093348\" target=\"new\"><b>SDK068PV Instalation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on double (french) pocket sliding doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Note:</b> The flush pulls <b>project 3/16\" off the door's face</b>. If you intend to use on a <b>pocket door</b>, please insure that you have <b>more than 3/16\" clearance</b> between the door's face and the wall pocket. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> privacy mortise lock body, two (2) oval flush pulls for lock, two (2) oval flush pulls for non locking door, two (2) edge pulls, strike plate and all mounting hardware. <b>For One Pair of Pocket Doors. (2 doors)</b>\r\n</p>",
